<view class="page"><view class="title">跟着地图，慢慢逛。</view><view class="subtitle">选择分区，或按清单串起这一趟采购。</view><view class="panel"><view class="row panel-head"><text>店内地图 · 1F</text><text class="tag">虚拟门店</text></view><scroll-view class="map-scroll" scroll-x scroll-y style="height:{{viewportHeight}}px"><canvas id="store-map" type="2d" style="width:{{canvasWidth}}px;height:{{canvasHeight}}px"/></scroll-view><view class="row map-tools"><picker mode="selector" range="{{positions}}" range-key="name" value="{{positionIndex}}" bindchange="position"><view class="position-control">我的位置：{{positions[positionIndex].name}}</view></picker><view class="row"><button class="small" data-delta="-0.2" bindtap="zoom" disabled="{{zoom <= 1}}">缩小</button><button class="small" data-delta="0.2" bindtap="zoom" disabled="{{zoom >= 1.8}}">放大</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{route}}" class="route"><view class="row"><view class="grow"><view class="item-name">前往 {{target}}</view><view class="note">约 {{route.distance}} 米 · {{route.minutes}} 分钟 · {{route.stops.length}} 个分区</view></view><button class="primary small" bindtap="next">模拟到达</button></view><button class="text-button" bindtap="toggle">{{expanded ? '收起' : '查看'}}步行指引</button><view wx:if="{{expanded}}"><view class="note" wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="*this">{{index+1}}. {{item}}</view></view></view></view><view class="note map-note">位置需手动设置，没有真实室内定位。放大后可滑动地图。</view><view class="section-title">想去哪个分区？</view><view class="zone-grid"><button wx:for="{{zones}}" wx:key="id" style="color:{{item.color}};background:{{item.tint}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select">{{item.code}} · {{item.name}}</button></view><view class="actions"><button class="primary" bindtap="plan">按购物清单规划</button><button bindtap="guide">继续导购对话</button></view></view>
